# Title: System Network Connections Discovery - Linux
# ID: 4c519226-f0cd-4471-bd2f-6fbb2bb68a79
# Status: test
# Level: low
# Author: Daniil Yugoslavskiy, oscd.community
# Date: 2020-10-19
# Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1049
# Description: Detects usage of system utilities to discover system network connections
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* sourcetype="syslog" (((process_path="*/who" OR process_path="*/w" OR process_path="*/last" OR process_path="*/lsof" OR process_path="*/netstat")) AND NOT ((parent_process_exec="*/usr/bin/landscape-sysinfo*" AND process_path="*/who")))
